  "notes": "{売|う}れる is an intransitive verb meaning 'to sell' (in the sense of being purchased) or 'to be popular.'\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{売|う}る→売る：00906_uru⟧ (transitive - to sell something)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- ⟦{売|う}れ→売る：00906_uru⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: is selling (ongoing), is popular\n- ⟦よく→よく：00601_yoku⟧⟦{売|う}れ→売る：00906_uru⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: is selling well\n\nSENSE 1 - TO BE SOLD:\n- ⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦{本|ほん}→本：00111_hon⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦よく→よく：00601_yoku⟧{売|う}れる: This book sells well\n- ⟦{全部|ぜんぶ}→全部：02888_zenbu⟧⟦{売|う}れ→売る：00906_uru⟧た: Everything sold out\n- ⟦{売|う}れ{行|ゆ}き→売れ行き：14897_ureyuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦いい→いい：00118_ii⟧: Sales are good\n\nSENSE 2 - TO BE POPULAR:\n- ⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{今|いま}→今：00945_ima⟧⟦{売|う}れ→売る：00906_uru⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: He's popular now\n- ⟦{売|う}れっ{子|こ}→売れっ子：12110_urekko⟧: popular person (entertainer, etc.)\n- ⟦{名前|なまえ}→名前：02234_namae⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{売|う}れる: to become famous\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{売|う}れ{残|のこ}り→売れ残り：27773_urenokori⟧: unsold items, leftovers\n- ⟦{売|う}れ{筋|すじ}→売れ筋：19249_uresuji⟧: best-selling items",
